  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Discover these spacious, brand-new family homes in one of Auckland’s most sought-after suburbs, just moments from Takapuna’s vibrant dining, shopping, and stunning beachfront. Enjoy the perfect balance of coastal living and city convenience.\r\n\r\nLot 1: 4 bedrooms, 4 bathrooms, 1 family room, 1 living room, 1 dining room, single garage\r\n\r\nLot 2: 3 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, 1 family room, 1 living room, 1 dining room, 1 study, single garage \r\n\r\nLot 3 & Lot 4: 4 bedrooms, 3 bathrooms, 1 family room, 1 living room, 1 dining room, 1 study, single garage \r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\r\n• Freehold title — no body corporate fees\r\n\r\n• 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\n• Spacious living area with a full bathroom and sliding doors opening to the garden —ideal as a guest room or potential fifth bedroom\r\n\r\n• Concrete block inter-tenancy wall between the duplex homes\r\n\r\n• Miele kitchen appliances and fully tiled bathrooms\r\n\r\n• Double-glazed windows, full insulation, and two heat pumps for year-round comfort\r\n\r\n• Internal-access garage providing secure and convenient parking\r\n\r\n• High-spec fixtures and quality finishes throughout \r\n\r\nEnjoy unbeatable convenience with Smales Farm, the Busway Station, and North Shore Hospital all within walking distance, while Takapuna CBD, the beach, cafés, and shopping are just minutes away. \r\n\r\nZoned for, or close to, some of Auckland’s most highly regarded schools, including:\r\n\r\n• Westlake Girls High School\r\n\r\n• Westlake Boys High School\r\n\r\n• Takapuna Grammar School\r\n\r\n• Takapuna Primary School\r\n\r\n• Takapuna Normal Intermediate\r\n\r\n• Carmel College\r\n\r\n• Rosmini College\r\n\r\n• St Joseph’s Primary School\r\n\r\nDon’t miss this opportunity to elevate your lifestyle and experience the very best of Takapuna living. Contact us today to arrange a viewing.",
